{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>You shall eat it in a pure place, you and your sons and your daughters with you.</b> It does not say 'in a holy place,' because He permitted its consumption to women, and women were not permitted to enter the court of the Tent of Meeting — as they said: 'from where do we know that a woman may enter the עזרה?' For the court of the Mishkan is the model of the עזרה in the Temple."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:24:36.454556054Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}